{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/112072-paris-lil-conv-april-27th-darkday-9-preys-predators","id":112072,"title":"[Paris] [lil' conv'] [April 27th] Darkday 9 : Preys & Predators","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-13T09:26:27-07:00","id":112072,"title":"[Paris] [lil' conv'] [April 27th] Darkday 9 : Preys & Predators","content":"Eeyah people !<br /> Our French RPG Club, <a href=\"http://www.tenebrae-mundis.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrae</a>, is specialized... is consecrated to the games published by White Wolf and Onyx Path (and to other contemporary-fantastic games too, in a lesser measure) and we regularly organize meets-up and small conv' where you are invited to come test all sort of games ! And we say, why not announce our next one on this very forum ?<br /> <br /> So, yup, sunday april 27th, we'll have our 9th Darkday, on the thematic of &quot;Preys and Predators&quot;, and you're invited !<br /> <br /> This will happen at the gamer bar <a href=\"http://lescavesalliees.fr/\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Les Caves Alli\u00e9es</i></a> (44 rue Gr\u00e9goire de Tours, 75006 Paris ; <a href=\"http://lescavesalliees.fr/?page_id=42\" target=\"_blank\">map there</a>), from midday to 7pm (but I'll wait for players from 11am and we hope to start ASAP), and we have already four games that are proposed...<ul><li><b>Aberrant</b>, when WW deals with super &quot;heroes&quot;, by Gilles 111</li> <li><b>Blood and Smoke : the Strix Chronicle</b>, the new version of <i>Vampire : the Requiem</i>, by Monsieur Meuble</li> <li><b>Friday Night's Zombie,</b> the new zombie-themed French RPG, by Meister</li> <li><b>Werewolf : the Forsaken</b>, the game of savage fury and deep inhumanity, by Renaud</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br /> If you wish so (and read French), you can have some previews of the scenarii on <a href=\"http://www.tenebrae-mundis.com/les-nuits-tenebrae/teasers-du-darkday-ix-proies-et-predateurs\" target=\"_blank\">thispage of teasers</a> ; and if you're definitely interested, you just need to fill <a href=\"http://inscription.tenebrae-mundis.com/index.php?page=inscription&amp;nuit=27\" target=\"_blank\">this perfect and elegant entry form</a>.<br /> The conv' is free... well, our host would really appreciate if you at least buy a little something, among his vast choice of microbrews, medieval alcohol, flower drinks and other foods of yore...<br /> <br /> And we are waiting for you !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2718-monsieur-meuble","name":"Monsieur Meuble","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2718_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}